* {{flagicon|USA}} [[Walter Berry (basketball)|Walter Berry]] – F, [[St. John's Redmen basketball|St. John's]] (junior)
* {{flagicon|USA}} [[Michael Graham (basketball)|Michael Graham]] – F, [[Georgetown Hoyas men's basketball|Georgetown]] (freshman)
* {{flagicon|USA}} Jerald Hyatt – G, [[Lincoln Memorial Railsplitters men's basketball|Lincoln Memorial]] (junior)
* {{flagicon|USA}} Andre Morgan – G, [[Hawaii Rainbow Warriors basketball|Hawaii]] (junior)
